        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Masako, Crown Princess of Japan; Naruhito; Michiko; Akihito\n- Roles: Crown Princess of Japan; Crown Prince of Japan; Empress of Japan; Emperor of Japan; heir apparent\n\nFacts:\n- Michiko was born as Michiko Shōda on 20 October 1934.\n- Akihito has reigned as the Emperor of Japan since 7 January 1989.\n- Michiko is the Empress of Japan as the wife of Akihito.\n- Masako, Crown Princess of Japan, was born as Masako Owada on 9 December 1963.\n- Masako is the wife of Naruhito, Crown Prince of Japan.\n- Naruhito is the eldest son of Emperor Akihito and Empress Michiko.\n- Naruhito is the heir apparent to the Chrysanthemum Throne.",
